        ("6.3",
         "What is the statutory fail-safe function of a Thermostatic Mixing Valve (TMV2 / TMV3) complying with BS EN 1111?",
         "符合英國標準 BS EN 1111 的恆溫混水閥（TMV），其核心的「故障安全保護 (Fail-Safe)」聯鎖機制是怎樣工作的？",
         {"A": "It rings an electric bell", "B": "If the cold water supply pressure fails completely, the valve shuts off the hot water flow almost instantaneously (within seconds) to prevent pure boiling water scalding the user", "C": "It pours water on the floor", "D": "It switches off the boiler"},
         {"A": "發出刺耳的電鈴聲報警", "B": "當冷水供水突然中斷（如冷水管停水或爆管）時，閥芯內的熱敏元件能在數分之一秒內完全自動「瞬間切斷」熱水出水，杜絕純滾燙熱水直噴人體引發慘劇", "C": "將熱水直接洩放到浴室地面上", "D": "向燃氣壁掛爐發送信號關機"},
         "B", "A certified TMV shuts down hot water delivery within a second if cold water pressure drops to zero, preventing instant catastrophic scalding.", "若無 Fail-safe 保護，洗澡時冷水一停，龍頭會噴出 60°C 以上沸水將人燙傷致殘。TMV 內部石蠟感溫包在失冷瞬間膨脹頂死熱水閥口，實現零熱水輸出。", "BS EN 1111 Sanitary tapware - Thermostatic mixing valves; TMV2 Scheme"),

