        ("6.2",
         "What is the purpose of the internal rubber diaphragm (membrane) and nitrogen gas pre-charge cushion in a hot water expansion vessel?",
         "在承壓熱水系統的「隔膜式膨脹水箱 (Expansion Vessel)」內部，橡膠隔膜與氮氣預充氣墊的核心功用是什麼？",
         {"A": "To filter sediment", "B": "To safely accommodate the volumetric thermal expansion of water as it is heated from cold, without lifting the 6 bar pressure relief valve", "C": "To keep the water cold", "D": "To increase water velocity"},
         {"A": "過濾自來水中的泥沙雜質", "B": "安全吸收全水罐冷水受熱升溫時產生的約 4% 體積熱膨脹增量，維持系統水壓平穩，防止頻繁衝擊 6 bar 洩壓閥跑水", "C": "使罐內水溫保持低溫狀態", "D": "成倍提高管內流水流速"},
         "B", "Water expands ~4% when heated. Water is incompressible; without an elastic nitrogen gas cushion to compress, pressure spikes would rupture the cylinder.", "水是不可壓縮的。200 升水加熱膨脹多出約 8 升水，膨脹水箱利用氣體的高度可壓縮性，將多出的水擠入氣囊，使系統壓力平穩受控在 3.5 到 4.5 bar 之間。", "BS EN 12828 / BS EN 12897; C&G Unit 205"),

