         {"A": "The water in the cylinder turns cold", "B": "Water repeatedly discharges from the 6 bar expansion relief valve (via the tundish) every time the cylinder heats up from cold", "C": "The incoming mains pipe freezes solid", "D": "The electricity tripping in the street"},
